<HelpChapterSection Id="home">
    <HelpTopicSection Id="home-overview">
        <p>The home page opens right after you sign in, and also via the <span class="help-ui">Home</span> link or the “KOD” logo. It gathers in one place everything that needs your attention.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>A greeting</strong> depending on the time of day (“Good morning”, “Good afternoon”…) with your name.</li>
            <li><strong>Quick actions</strong>: <span class="help-ui">New document</span> — opens document creation (requires the “Create documents” permission); <span class="help-ui">Sign a file</span> — opens file signing (requires the “Signing and verifying files” permission).</li>
            <li><strong>Awaiting my signature</strong> — up to 5 documents where it is currently your turn to sign, shown as “No. number · type · author”. Click a document to open it, or <span class="help-ui">All</span> to see the full list. If the queue is empty, you will see “All signed” — “No new documents to sign.”</li>
            <li><strong>News</strong> — the three latest posts (pinned ones first), with category and date. <span class="help-ui">All</span> opens the news feed. If there are no posts yet — “No news yet”.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Blocks you don't have permissions for are not shown.</p>
    </HelpTopicSection>

    <HelpTopicSection Id="home-indicators">
        <p>Four cards with counters; each one is a link to the filtered document registry:</p>
        <div class="help-table-wrap">
            <table class="help-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Card</th><th>What it counts</th><th>Where it leads</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr><td>Awaiting my signature</td><td>Documents where it is currently your turn. If there are more than zero, the card is highlighted in black.</td><td>The “Awaiting my signature” tab</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>My drafts</td><td>Your documents with the “Draft” status.</td><td>“Created by me” + the “Draft” status</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>My documents in signing</td><td>Your documents that others are currently signing.</td><td>“Created by me” + “In signing”</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Signed by me this month</td><td>Documents you have signed since the beginning of the current month.</td><td>“Signed by me”</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </HelpTopicSection>
</HelpChapterSection>
